      "message": "I like ShaderCodeDictionary being able to provide the uniforms for its recorded shaders, but I\u0027m a little wary of having to have the code dictionary around when building the shader keys. My other comment goes into a bit more detail, but it mostly wondering how that affects key generation for paint params that were missed by pre-compilation.",
